is the Microsoft version. 1989 NSF that is the National Sound Foundation of USA. It replaces

00:11:31.700 --> 00:11:40.200
ARPANET as internet backbone and then WWW was invented by CERN physicist Tim Berners-Lee

00:11:40.200 --> 00:11:52.580
in 1991. So, this advent of WWW that means the worldwide web really made the network very

00:11:52.580 --> 00:11:59.280
very popular. So, there was this kind of positive feedback going on as it became more popular

00:11:59.280 --> 00:12:05.000
more and more people jumped into it as people showed their interest. So, commercial companies

00:12:05.000 --> 00:12:10.320
also then became interested because there would be a market for something in networks

00:12:10.320 --> 00:12:15.160
that they do and when the commercial companies developed something naturally it became more

00:12:15.160 --> 00:12:20.540
easier to use the network they had more functionalities. So, more people became interested. So, that

00:12:20.540 --> 00:12:26.920
was the positive loop which made this I mean actually then the growth of network

00:12:26.920 --> 00:12:31.320
in the past decade that means in the 90s let us say has been absolutely phenomenal

00:12:32.100 --> 00:12:39.020
and if the basic so called killer app that is the killer application the application which

00:12:39.020 --> 00:12:49.490
attracted so many people to network was this WWW which was invented in 1991. In 1992 Mosaic

